==To Start==
Speak with [[Arch Druid Camellia]] located in front of the [[Druid Academy]] in [[Shrouded Glade]].
==Goals==
Arch Druid Camellia in Shrouded Glade has asked you to aid the dwarves of Sunstone Valley.
*Talk to Headmaster Merk
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Arch Druid Camellia]] located in front of the [[Druid Academy]] in [[Shrouded Glade]].
#*"Gus Geargrinder sacrificed everything to save us from the Gloam. Now we have a chance to repay him.<br />A group called the Skullz has taken over <font color='#D9781A'>Sunstone Valley</font>, putting Gus' friends and family in great danger!<br />If you want to help, find and speak with <font color='#D9781A'>Headmaster Merk</font>." -Arch Druid Camellia
#Speak with [[Headmaster Merk]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Arch Druid Camellia sent you?<br />That's great! The situation here is bad and we can definitely use your help." -Headmaster Merk

